      "Text": "Security update for distribution",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for distribution fixes the following issues\n\n- CVE-2026-39821: golang.org/x/net/idna: failure to reject ASCII-only Punycode-encoded labels allows for validation bypass and privilege escalation (bsc#1266629).\n- CVE-2026-56852: golang.org/x/text/unicode/norm: infinite loop on truncated/invalid UTF-8 input (bsc#1272132).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
